{"id":161,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"When Sentret sleeps, it does so while another stands guard. The sentry wakes the others at the first sign of danger. When this Pokémon becomes separated from its pack, it becomes incapable of sleep due to fear."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"It stands on its tail so it can see a long way. If it spots an enemy, it cries loudly to warn its kind."},{"games":["X","Crystal"],"text":"When acting as a lookout, it warns others of danger by screeching and hitting the ground with its tail."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas."},{"games":["HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"A very cautious Pokémon, it raises itself up using its tail to get a better view of its surroundings."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"They take turns standing guard when it is time to sleep. The sentry awakens the others if it senses danger. If one becomes separated, it turns sleepless with fear."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Run Away","hidden":false,"description":"Enables a sure getaway from wild Pokémon."},{"name":"Keen Eye","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's keen eyes prevent its accuracy from being lowered."},{"name":"Frisk","hidden":true,"description":"When it enters a battle, the Pokémon can check an opposing Pokémon's held item."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"grassland","color":"Brown","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":161,"name":"Sentret","condition":null,"children":[{"id":162,"name":"Furret","condition":"Lv. 15","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,10],[4,111],[7,98],[13,154],[16,270],[19,266],[25,21],[28,156],[31,389],[36,133],[39,226],[42,38],[47,304]],"machine":[133,226,59,34,280,451,204,886,91,38,283,203,263,7,53,374,264,447,270,304,58